+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B in the nontrivial q-block switching-set regime of Definition "
+        "1 and Section 3.2: exact row-pair signature bucketing runs in "
+        "O(v^3/w) bit-word work for v=q^2 and solves every instance; at the "
